{%- comment -%}
  OUTREACH HERO — the Outreach page's hero (Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava,
  Styles/_video-hero.scss), as Renew's.

  Block:                    an HTML block in the Outreach page's Feature zone
  Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/OutreachHero.lava' %}
  Enabled Lava Commands:    none
  Page:                     InnerDefault, PageHeaderStyle Hidden, DarkHeader
                            checked

  The lead line under "Outreach" is the page's Description (Page Properties).
  No video yet: a labelled green placeholder stands in. When the video is in
  Rock, delete heroPlaceholder and set heroMediaId to its media element id.
  No button for now (no events yet).

  The page content under it: Assets/Lava/Outreach.lava (Main zone).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heroPlaceholder = 'Video: Outreach' -%}
{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava' %}
